"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。Unity 的 2D Freeform 与 UE 的 BlendSpace 内部都做类似三角剖分 + 重心插值（具体到边界外推还有梯度带等变体）。维度再高、采样点再多，手工调权重就不现实了——这正是 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/motion-matching\">动作匹配与运动场</a> 想用&quot;检索&quot;取代&quot;混合空间&quot;的动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合树-把节点级联起来\">混合树：把节点级联起来</h2><p>单个混合空间不够时，把多个混合节点组织成一棵求值树就是混合树（blend tree）。叶子是动画片段或混合空间，内部节点是混合操作（按权重融合、加法叠加、按布尔选择），根输出最终姿态。例如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Blend (受伤程度)&#10;├── Locomotion 2D BlendSpace (速度/方向)   ← 健康时&#10;└── Limp 1D BlendSpace (速度)              ← 受伤时\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Blend (受伤程度)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Locomotion 2D BlendSpace (速度/方向)   ← 健康时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Limp 1D BlendSpace (速度)              ← 受伤时</span></span></code></pre></div><p>混合树求值是一次自底向上的姿态计算：先采样叶子，再逐层混合到根。它与状态机正交——一棵混合树通常就是状态机里<strong>一个状态</strong>的内容，状态机负责在不同混合树之间切换。这个分工是下一篇 <a href=\"state-machines\">动画状态机</a> 的主题，这里只强调：混合树管&quot;在一个状态内怎么连续融&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合的两种语义-覆盖与加法\">混合的两种语义：覆盖与加法</h2><p>到目前为止说的都是<strong>插值混合</strong>（权重和为 1，结果在输入之间）。还有一种<strong>加法混合</strong>：把一个&quot;差异姿态&quot;叠加到基础姿态上，权重控制叠加强度。瞄准偏移（aim offset）就是典型——基础是跑步循环，叠一层&quot;相对中立姿态向上瞄&quot;的差异，角色就能边跑边把枪指向不同俯仰角。加法层的完整机制（包括如何制作差异姿态、与遮罩的配合）留给 <a href=\"layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a>，这里点明它和插值混合是两套不可混淆的数学。</p>\n<p>混淆这两者是新手最常见的错误：把一个本该加法叠加的瞄准偏移片段当成普通片段塞进插值混合树，结果不是&quot;在跑步上叠一点瞄准偏转&quot;，而是&quot;把跑步和瞄准姿态各取一半&quot;，角色会变成半蹲半瞄的怪姿势。判断准则很简单——问这段动画&quot;是要替换底层、还是要在底层之上加一点扰动&quot;。替换走插值，扰动走加法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合权重的归一化与边界外推\">混合权重的归一化与边界外推</h2><p>二维混合空间还有一个常被忽略的细节：当参数点落到所有采样点张成的凸包之外（比如玩家以一个采样点没覆盖到的斜向速度移动）时，重心坐标会出现负权重，直接用会让姿态崩坏。引擎对此有两种处理：<strong>钳制（clamp）</strong> 把参数点拉回凸包边界上最近的合法点；<strong>外推（extrapolate）</strong> 则允许负权重在一定范围内成立，让运动在边界外仍平滑延伸。前者安全但在边界处略显僵硬，后者自然但需限制幅度防失控。一个稳妥的做法是先求原始权重，再做非负钳制与重新归一化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i&#x27; = \\frac{\\max(w_i,\\,0)}{\\sum_j \\max(w_j,\\,0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5488em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这保证权重恒为非负且和为 1，是工程上兼顾稳定与可接受质量的折中。设计混合空间时让采样点尽量覆盖玩家可能产生的全部参数范围，是从源头规避这个问题的根本办法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>混合空间用少量采样点 + 连续参数实时融出无穷多中间姿态。</li>\n<li>姿态混合底层是逐骨 LERP/SLERP；1D 用相邻插值，2D 用重心坐标。</li>\n<li>步频不同步是混合大坑，靠归一化相位对齐解决。</li>\n<li>混合树把多个混合节点级联成求值树，通常对应状态机里一个状态的内容。</li>\n<li>插值混合（和为 1）与加法混合（叠差异）是两套语义，后者详见分层篇。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合空间与混合树","id":"混合空间与混合树"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一维混合空间","id":"一维混合空间"},{"level":2,"text":"二维混合空间与重心坐标","id":"二维混合空间与重心坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"混合树：把节点级联起来","id":"混合树-把节点级联起来"},{"level":2,"text":"混合的两种语义：覆盖与加法","id":"混合的两种语义-覆盖与加法"},{"level":2,"text":"混合权重的归一化与边界外推","id":"混合权重的归一化与边界外推"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动画资产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/foundations/animation-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines"}}